Cell["\<\
There is no redshift due to a cross polarized wave in the x/z plane of our \
geometry. This is because when a  GW stretches and compresses spacetime there \
are four nodes which are not affected. For a cross-polarized wave (traveling \
along the z-axis), all points in the x/z plane are not affected. There will \
be a redshift effect in 3D \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9546084336095943`*^9, 
  3.954608560731288*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"296d96a2-eac8-4a63-b354-\
c14eac4abf43"],

