Cell["\<\
either write r in terms of tP and t? or write x in terms of \[Theta], \[Phi], \
etc? Try both and compare. 
In this case, r = DP[tP,  t] = c(tP-t). You can take the derivative with \
respect to tP or t, they are equal and opposite \
